{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af146b7","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"E6cpb6kvluJM8OGuDcFBT","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Data Cleanup\n\nData cleanup is the process of identifying and resolving quality issues in a dataset before analysis. Raw data from real-world sources almost always contains errors, missing values, duplicates, and inconsistencies. Thorough cleaning ensures that analysis results reflect reality rather than artifacts of data collection.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Data Cleaning","url":"https://www.tableau.com/learn/articles/what-is-data-cleaning#:~:text=tools%20and%20software-,What%20is%20data%20cleaning%3F,to%20be%20duplicated%20or%20mislabeled.","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a6b"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/E6cpb6kvluJM8OGuDcFBT.md"}